    <string name="altitude_title">Altitude limit (Lito X1)</string>
    <string name="altitude_desc">Writes the flight controller\'s max altitude: 500 m, the ceiling the Lito X1 itself reports as its maximum, or 120 m back. Two routes for 500 m: port 40008 like the LED write, or port 40009 inside a service-mode session, the route both hardware measurements used. Try 40008 first; check the max altitude slider in DJI Fly after each. Stays after DJI Fly reconnects. Requires DJI Fly running with aircraft connected. The height rules where you fly still apply.</string>
